  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/bARZ5Zc.png\" width=\"840\" height=\"105\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/fk8AIEm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"115\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">***&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shetiphiancore\" rel=\"nofollow\">ShetiPhianCore</a> 必備！ ***</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">將液體儲存在另一個維度中。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/B0NBcH4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"85\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">終界儲液槽</h2><p style=\"text-align:center\">所有相同顏色的儲液槽始終相連。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">提供全域、個人和隊伍模式。（<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/endertanks/pages/main\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多詳情</a>）。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">手持染料對著儲液槽 Shift + 右鍵以更改條紋顏色。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/984/tanks-crop.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"459\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/B0NBcH4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"85\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">終界桶</h2><p style=\"text-align:center\">連結至儲液槽，方便取用儲存的液體。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">對著儲液槽 Shift + 右鍵以進行連結。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/985/bucket-crop-f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"284\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/B0NBcH4.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"70\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>請在 <a href=\"https://github.com/ShetiPhian/Localizations-and-Issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上提交在地化檔案。</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>請勿在留言區回報錯誤，請使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/ShetiPhian/Localizations-and-Issues/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤器</a>。</strong></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
